{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは👩‍🏫"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週の欅って書かない?は、地元ロケプレゼン大会でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は、地元山形をプレゼンしました🍒"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレゼンに登場した銀山温泉♨︎"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPQDB3T0MS52D2ZV5JRTVD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">能登屋旅館に泊まりました。\n内装もとっても綺麗で、洞窟風呂はとても気持ち良かったです!\nご飯も最高だったな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPQEARH5WN66BE5EGVQY3V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">山形牛のしゃぶしゃぶ🐄\n朝ごはんも最高でした☀️"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPQF9QC8M9YZFZ6BXZHX48","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">湯豆腐、美味しかった〜\n全てが新鮮!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPQGBPVV5KQAGTMCMAE4NF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n焼き立てのカレーパンも💓"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPQHD9M8VA0FVK8RRMBPDD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nぺー…🐈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特に冬は趣があってとてもおすすめです!"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHYPQJDC7BPP79YP2RCYS330","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気になった方は是非、山形に遊びに行ってみて下さいね☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週のけやかけでは、おすすめの地元グルメを紹介します🍴\n楽しみに〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"長沢菜々香"}],"source":"archive"}